@title EMC findings are triangles on the drawing, with a popover and a fix preview (1366x768)
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768
# T11: with the EMC check on, each finding is a triangle on its wire or device; the popover names the source, has the design-aid caveat behind a ?, Preview the fix and Open EMC check.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text EMC check
key enter
wait 10
click_text "Run the EMC rules with the design checks"
wait 10
key Escape
wait 10
shot emc-triangles
check_layout
click 255 158
wait 6
expect "Open EMC check"
expect "Sensitive device near drive"
expect "Preview the fix"
shot emc-popover
check_layout
# Preview the fix shows what it would change in the EMC window; nothing changes until Apply.
click_text "Preview the fix" Button
wait 12
expect "EMC check"
expect "Preview"
shot emc-fix-preview
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
# The flag is still there until the fix is applied: the pill still counts it.
expect "warnings"
